\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Corridor rumour and official record. (a)\nonbreakingspace A resignation rumour is seeded with one member in the wandelgang. Members reach $27\%$ awareness on day\nonbreakingspace 1 and $\approx 100\%$ by day\nonbreakingspace 7; the press is faster ($60\%$, then $100\%$), and ministers lag ($0\%$, then $70\%$), as the transmission probabilities in \S  \ref {sec:agents} imply. Only $4\%$ of Handelingen lines mention the leak. (b)\nonbreakingspace Floor mention of the leak against Chair strictness, which lowers the heuristic allusion rate and, from $2\times $, how often the Chair gives the floor.}}{7}{figure.caption.28}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:s1s3}{{2}{7}{Corridor rumour and official record. (a)~A resignation rumour is seeded with one member in the wandelgang. Members reach $27\%$ awareness on day~1 and $\approx 100\%$ by day~7; the press is faster ($60\%$, then $100\%$), and ministers lag ($0\%$, then $70\%$), as the transmission probabilities in \S \ref {sec:agents} imply. Only $4\%$ of Handelingen lines mention the leak. (b)~Floor mention of the leak against Chair strictness, which lowers the heuristic allusion rate and, from $2\times $, how often the Chair gives the floor}{figure.caption.28}{}}
